<title>UK: Ghana cocoa purchases total 19,308 T in 4th week.</title>
<headline>Ghana cocoa purchases total 19,308 T in 4th week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ghana cocoa purchases in the fourth week of the 1996/97 season ending November 7 amounted to 19,308 tonnes compared with 21,933 in the same 1995/96 period.</p>
<p>The Ghana Cocoa Board said on Tuesday purchases at the end of the fourth week were a cumulative 94,500 tonnes compared with 87,520 in the week ending November 2, 1995.</p>
<p>-- Jalil Hamid, London newsroom +44 171 542 4985</p>
